WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.780
It's almost midnight, and parents are still
asking the same thing every single evening.

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:10.680
Now all the answers you need
are in one single place.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:16.680
Parents register themselves, review and sign
the digital contract, and complete their payment,

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.700
all within the same platform.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.020
It simplifies the entire process
for everyone involved.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.980
Four minutes, and you were already asleep.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.940
And it's like that for the whole season.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.340
No more reminding parents about money.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.760
Attendance: just one click.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:40.500
Contracts without paper.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:43.740
You see everything.

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.480
Less administration, more time for teaching.

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:02.280
ExoClass. Start the season without chaos.
